Database migrations (Alembic).

  alembic upgrade head                           apply every migration (run on each deploy)
  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "message"   create a migration after changing app/models.py
  alembic downgrade -1                           undo the last migration
  alembic current                                show which migration the database is at

The database address comes from DATABASE_URL (see .env.example), never from this folder.
Always read an autogenerated migration before committing it.
